# VSCO double bass, bowed: Recorded sustained double bass without vibrato; orchestral low lines, not a plucked groove bass.
# Compare the soft and firm phrases; then listen to short notes and space between answers.
song "Bass: VSCO double bass, bowed" 100 4/4 Dm fps=30 seed=82 tail=2 mood=balanced
inst bass=sampler/double_bass_arco(gain_db=0)
chords Dm
soft 2 | bass:{rel: "R/2_ 5/2_ | R/2. r/4", oct: -2} dyn=p<mp
answer 2 | bass:{rel: "R/2_ R+/2_ | 5/2_ R/4 r/4", oct: -2} dyn=mf>mp
mix bass -4 sc=0
master standard lufs=-18 glue=none
